    <th>Description of Fix</th>
  </tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="file-col">src/pages/Shop.jsx</td>
      <td class="sev-col"><span class="badge b-p3">P3</span></td>
      <td class="desc-col">
        <strong>Two improvements:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Initial product and category fetch had no <code>try/catch</code> — any network error resulted in an unhandled promise rejection and a broken shop page. Wrapped in <code>try/finally</code>; <code>productService</code> already falls back to local JSON on error so the page remains functional offline.</li>
          <li>The active filter count badge (shown on the mobile "Filters" button) did not include the price range slider. Added <code>maxPrice &lt; maxPriceLimit</code> to the array of conditions so the badge accurately reflects all applied constraints.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

