<h3>Deployment Checklist</h3>
<p>The project is Vercel-ready. Before deploying:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Set <code>MONGODB_URI</code> on the backend Vercel project (MongoDB Atlas, whitelist <code>0.0.0.0/0</code>)</li>
  <li>Set <code>JWT_SECRET</code> (minimum 64 random characters)</li>
  <li>Set <code>FRONTEND_URL</code> on the backend to the deployed frontend URL</li>
  <li>Set <code>VITE_API_URL</code> on the frontend to the deployed backend URL + <code>/api/v1</code></li>
  <li>Set Cloudinary credentials if image upload is needed</li>
  <li>Run seed script once against a staging database to populate demo data</li>
</ul>

